    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/28e09d18389506a2376f74df53f9529e.poster.avif?t=1754247794\" width=600 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/28e09d18389506a2376f74df53f9529e.webm?t=1754247794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate and compete in intense volleyball matches! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your character, perform spikes, passes, attacks, and blocks to try to win your matches! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spikerz! features simple, easy-to-learn controls with endless gameplay possibilities! Each match is a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Best</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your position and stats before each match, balancing speed, power, and jump. Find the perfect combination and become a devastating Spikerz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate to Dominate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spikerz! supports matches from 1v1 to 6v6. You won\u2019t always be alone on your team, so work together and become a formidable team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/f7a77ae73772c2b9df48b29050c15926.avif?t=1754247794\" width=600 height=123 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/28e09d18389506a2376f74df53f9529e.poster.avif?t=1754247794\" width=600 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/28e09d18389506a2376f74df53f9529e.webm?t=1754247794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate and compete in intense volleyball matches! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your character, perform spikes, passes, attacks, and blocks to try to win your matches! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spikerz! features simple, easy-to-learn controls with endless gameplay possibilities! Each match is a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Best</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your position and stats before each match, balancing speed, power, and jump. Find the perfect combination and become a devastating Spikerz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate to Dominate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spikerz! supports matches from 1v1 to 6v6. You won\u2019t always be alone on your team, so work together and become a formidable team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786900/extras/f7a77ae73772c2b9df48b29050c15926.avif?t=1754247794\" width=600 height=123 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Move, receive, pass, attack, and block in this intense volleyball game! Rack up wins, either alone or with others in local multiplayer mode!",
